Z||000000||The Fieromaster||12-20-2001||01:20 PM||||Ok i cant be the only one who does this but...<P>On the way to work today it was kinda wet.  The freeway entrance ramp is a 275* large circle...  SO i jumped on 2nd gear a bit to slide the rear end out and carried it almost all the way up the ramp!!! NOTE that it was 11pm and no one was around to injure but myself!  I just thought it was fun and cant wait for another rainy day to do it again!  I also want to find some secluded roads to try drifting on!!  I do it alot pulling onto streets... James should remember the one i did leaving the car wash, and the look on the rice drivers face when i drifted into the lane next to him!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> Hehehe!<P>------------------<BR>        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif">        <FONT COLOR="red"><B>"Raced That, Wrecked Better"</FONT></B>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif">   <BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/thefieromastersig.gif">    <BR><B>~In Memory Of Jesse Cesek~ 1980-2000</B><BR><FONT COLOR="blue"><B>AOL IM: Fieromaster</B></FONT><BR><B><FONT COLOR="purple">1985 GT ~ Purple, Black and Yellow Interior(Fastback Converted)</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="maroon">1997 Mitsu Eclipse GSX ~ Maroon w/ Hella Balls!(GSX = AWD, Turbo) DOA on 12/10/2000</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="green">1992 Mitsubishi Eclipse GS ~ soon will be turboed</FONT><BR></B>||||reg||10
Z||000001||FieroJoe||12-20-2001||01:26 PM||||There are a few on ramps up here that are really really tight turns.  I can feel the rear end just wanting to step right out!  My rear sway bar probably attributes to a little bit of that, but it still is a wierd feeling!  Never taken it at a time where I was the only one around, its a pretty busy place most of the time.||||reg||1
